{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "n1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1900,
   "y": -560,
   "width": 1000,
   "height": 170,
   "text": "# CSA2 attention (L2, Full mode) — true-scale matrices\nQ is an hourglass (wq_a flat → wq_b tall); KV is one thin 512-wide head. Compressor + indexer exist only in some layers: **Full** = own compressor + indexer (2, 8, 14, 20), **Reindex** = own indexer, shared KV (24, 28, 32, 36), **Reuse** = neither."
  },
  {
   "id": "n2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -800,
   "y": -560,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "# How to read\n- **Rectangle = weight matrix W[out×in]**: width = in, height = out, **0.04 px per channel** in this tab → **area = parameters**.\n- **Stacked offset copies** = the same matrix repeated (heads, experts, layers).\n- **Thin grey bar** = one token's activation; width = channels.\n- Zoom out to compare; nothing is resized for readability."
  },
  {
   "id": "n3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -102,
   "y": -300,
   "width": 205,
   "height": 10,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "n4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -130,
   "y": -346,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`5120` x after attn_norm"
  },
  {
   "id": "n5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -102,
   "y": -250,
   "width": 205,
   "height": 51,
   "text": "**wq_a**",
   "color": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "n6",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 116,
   "y": -250,
   "width": 360,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**wq_a** `1280×5120`\nQ down-projection (FP8)"
  },
  {
